  "rationale": "The rule reports 2 maturity_not_past violations for report date 2025-09-30. The current SOI debt rows for Encompass Digital Media in table 6 show maturities of 09/28/26, which are not past the report date. The same two Encompass instruments in comparative table 12 show 09/28/25, which is before the report date and matches the violation count. This grounds the flag as a real extraction error caused by comparative-period maturity values leaking into current-period holdings, not a false alarm in the rule."
